# The image already sets HOME/COLLIE_STATE_DIR=/state, COLLIE_MUX=tmux,
# COLLIE_HOST=0.0.0.0 (+ COLLIE_ALLOW_NON_LOOPBACK_BIND) and COLLIE_SKIP_SERVE=1
# (traefik is the front door, never `tailscale serve`).
#
# Same-origin gate: the web and websecure origins the phone opens. Host
# validation fails closed, but collie also accepts the host of every allowed
# origin, so the public hostname needs no COLLIE_PUBLIC_HOSTS entry. Leave
# COLLIE_PUBLIC_HOSTS unset: crew traffic never checks it, and a tailnet host
# listed there would open the browser API on the tailnet, where no SSO applies.
COLLIE_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://collie.${BASE_DOMAIN:=libre.pod},https://collie.${BASE_DOMAIN:=libre.pod}
